<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  5.11%			 O/N = 5.12%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  7.67%			 T/N = 5.12%</p>
<p>		   Nov 21, 1996			Nov 20, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  7.16%	1 month forward =  7.16%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  8.52%	2 month forward =  8.19%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  8.86%	3 month forward =  8.64%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  9.20%	4 month forward =  8.95%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  9.34%	5 month forward =  9.14%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  9.36%	6 month forward =  9.08%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
